{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T12:41:10.707Z","entries":{"docs-7.24\u0000## interface/pptp-client/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/pptp-client/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.24\u0000## interface/sstp-server/server **Type:** Settings Directory":"## interface/sstp-server/server \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.24\u0000## interface/wifi/aaa **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wifi/aaa \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## interface/wifi/provisioning **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wifi/provisioning \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## interface/wireless/nstreme **Package:** wireless-rep **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wireless/nstreme \n**包：** wireless-rep\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## interface/wireless/registration-table **Package:** wireless-rep **Type:** Directory":"## interface/wireless/registration-table \n**包：** wireless-rep\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.24\u0000## interface/wireless/registration-table/reset-counters **Package:** wireless-rep **Type:** Command":"## interface/wireless/registration-table/reset-counters \n**包：** wireless-rep\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.24\u0000:::info Interface Access Control You can restrict management access to the device by interface. If you wish to prevent access from a specific interface(e.g., `wlan1`), simply remove that interface from the corresponding bridge VLAN entry. :::":":::info 接口访问控制\n可以按接口限制对设备的管理访问。如果希望阻止从特定接口（例如 `wlan1`）访问，只需从对应的网桥 VLAN 条目中移除该接口。\n:::","docs-7.24\u0000:::info Interface Access Control 可以按接口限制对设备的管理访问。如果希望阻止从特定接口(例如 `wlan1`)访问，只需从对应的网桥 VLAN 条目中移除该接口。 :::":":::info 接口访问控制\n可以按接口限制对设备的管理访问。如果希望阻止从特定接口（例如 `wlan1`）访问，只需从对应的网桥 VLAN 条目中移除该接口。\n:::","docs-7.24\u0000:::warning Handling Wireless & HW-Offloaded VLANs For devices with hardware-offloaded VLAN filtering and wireless support(e.g., RB4011, LtAP), exercise caution. Packets flowing from HW-offloaded ports to wireless interfaces may be dropped if CPU access for that VLAN is not explicitly permitted. To allow CPU access for a specific VLAN: * **Add the bridge interface** as a member of that VLAN(see the VLAN99 example). * **Alternatively, disable HW offloading** on the affected bridge ports. :::":":::warning 处理 Wireless 和硬件卸载 VLAN\n对于同时支持硬件卸载 VLAN 过滤和 Wireless 的设备（例如 RB4011、LtAP），请谨慎操作。如果未明确允许某个 VLAN 访问 CPU，则从硬件卸载端口流向无线接口的数据包可能会被丢弃。\n\n要允许特定 VLAN 访问 CPU：\n\n* **添加网桥接口**作为该 VLAN 的成员（请参阅 VLAN99 示例）。\n* **或者，在受影响的网桥端口上禁用 HW offloading**。\n:::","docs-7.24\u0000:::warning Handling Wireless & HW-Offloaded VLANs 对于同时支持硬件卸载 VLAN 过滤和 Wireless 的设备(例如 RB4011、LtAP)，请谨慎操作。如果未明确允许某个 VLAN 访问 CPU，则从硬件卸载端口流向无线接口的数据包可能会被丢弃。 要允许特定 VLAN 访问 CPU： * **添加网桥接口**作为该 VLAN 的成员(请参阅 VLAN99 示例)。 * **或者，在受影响的网桥端口上禁用 HW offloading**。 :::":":::warning 处理 Wireless 和硬件卸载 VLAN\n对于同时支持硬件卸载 VLAN 过滤和 Wireless 的设备（例如 RB4011、LtAP），请谨慎操作。如果未明确允许某个 VLAN 访问 CPU，则从硬件卸载端口流向无线接口的数据包可能会被丢弃。\n\n要允许特定 VLAN 访问 CPU：\n\n* **添加网桥接口**作为该 VLAN 的成员（请参阅 VLAN99 示例）。\n* **或者，在受影响的网桥端口上禁用 HW offloading**。\n:::"}}
